<title>USA: Pinkerton's acquires Co in North Carolina.</title>
<headline>Pinkerton's acquires Co in North Carolina.</headline>
<dateline>ENCINO, Calif. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pinkerton's Inc said Friday it has acquired ProNet Image &amp; Audio Inc, a North Carolina-based regional electronic systems integration firm.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were undisclosed.</p>
<p>&quot;The addition of ProNet to the Pinkerton Systems Integration Division is another step in acquiring the very best systems integrators in the security industry,&quot; said Denis Brown, chief executive officer.</p>
</text>
